Cell["Flyhash encoding", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"0926e627-39c6-47a6-b60d-bd6589eff127"],

Cell["\<\
A variant of the general-purpose vector encoding discussed above, the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]flyhash\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] algorithm encodes a \
dense vector into a sparse binary representation. \
